SparkFlash

================================================================================
Prior Art, Architectural Provenance, and Third-Party Attributions
================================================================================

SparkFlash's Rust runtime and CUDA C++ (.cu / .cuh) kernels draw heavily from
the architectural concepts, hardware discoveries, and terminology introduced by
existing open-source projects in the NVIDIA DGX Spark (GB10 / sm_121a) and
DeepSeek inference community. While the Rust crates and CUDA C++ kernels in
this repository are custom implementations written for SparkFlash, the system
architecture and naming ("RoCEnante" and the "b12x_*" kernel prefix) build
directly upon the pioneering work of the projects and authors below, who are
gratefully acknowledged.

SparkFlash is an independent open-source project and is not affiliated with,
sponsored by, or endorsed by Local Inference Lab, NVIDIA Corporation, or
DeepSeek AI. All project names, product names, and trademarks mentioned in this
repository are the property of their respective owners and are used solely for
identification and attribution under Apache License 2.0 Section 6.

